{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"A\n    \n      mavlink_interface_node reads RC_CHANNELS directly\n      Add RC channel monitoring to the existing mavlink_interface_node. It already owns the pymavlink connection, so it can read RC_CHANNELS messages and call the StartMission/ResumeMission services internally when channels 14/15 cross a threshold (e.g., PWM > 1700).\n      \n        \n          Pros\n          \n            No new nodes — minimal code change\n            mavlink_interface already has the pymavlink connection\n            Single source of truth for all MAVLink interaction\n            RC channels are broadcast at high rate (~50Hz) by ArduPilot\n          \n        \n        \n          Cons\n          \n            Adds responsibility to an already busy node\n            mavlink_interface becomes aware of mission concepts (start/resume)","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1774917437686}
